<title>USA: Omaha cattle firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter Steers and heifers fairly active, prices firm. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1100-1350 lbs 64.00-65.00. Select 61.00-63.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to more Choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs 63.50-65.00. Select 60.00-63.00.</p>
